WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.454 --> 00:00:03.537
(soft ambient music)

00:00:07.183 --> 00:00:10.933
- Devils Tower is an
amazingly special place.

00:00:13.759 --> 00:00:16.564
It's just up and out of the prairie, like,

00:00:16.564 --> 00:00:18.147
what happened here?

00:00:20.796 --> 00:00:25.023
There's something inexplicable,
but happily undeniable

00:00:25.023 --> 00:00:27.690
about the power of Devils Tower.

00:00:29.519 --> 00:00:32.647
(bouncy orchestral violin music)

00:00:32.647 --> 00:00:35.024
I'm Frank Sanders, and I am professional

00:00:35.024 --> 00:00:36.636
rock climbing guide.

00:00:36.636 --> 00:00:40.803
I'm not sure how I got here,
but the shoe really fits.

00:00:43.298 --> 00:00:44.888
I've been climbing since I was 15,

00:00:44.888 --> 00:00:47.397
so I guess I've been climbing 50 years.

00:00:47.397 --> 00:00:50.147
I'm 65 years old, still doin' it.

00:00:53.106 --> 00:00:56.376
The first time I saw the
Devils Tower up real and close

00:00:56.376 --> 00:00:59.126
was June of 1972, and that night

00:01:00.575 --> 00:01:02.447
the sky was full of lightning.

00:01:02.447 --> 00:01:06.711
The flashes, the booms,
illuminated the tower.

00:01:06.711 --> 00:01:08.381
It was intimidating, sure.

00:01:08.381 --> 00:01:12.548
That's why I came all that
way, to be intimidated.

00:01:16.773 --> 00:01:20.940
I have somewhere around
2,000 ascents of the tower.

00:01:21.883 --> 00:01:26.243
The joy in guiding is to
be along when somebody else

00:01:26.243 --> 00:01:29.594
hits that experience,
and you get to share it.

00:01:29.594 --> 00:01:30.844
It's fantastic.

00:01:32.162 --> 00:01:36.329
The rock wants to be climbed,
and if you look at the rock,

00:01:37.290 --> 00:01:41.486
the rock will show you
right where to touch

00:01:41.486 --> 00:01:43.319
and how hard to touch.

00:01:46.629 --> 00:01:48.379
Right on, partner.

00:01:48.379 --> 00:01:51.446
The tower is a every-ready partner.

00:01:51.446 --> 00:01:53.184
I don't wanna sound too trippy here,

00:01:53.184 --> 00:01:55.931
but you touch it, it touches you.

00:01:55.931 --> 00:01:59.264
(bouncy clapping music)

00:02:02.644 --> 00:02:05.288
Gettin' to the top of the
tower is both a physical

00:02:05.288 --> 00:02:08.288
and an emotional, spiritual journey.

00:02:10.038 --> 00:02:11.897
Looks like I can't do it,
but then in your heart

00:02:11.897 --> 00:02:13.564
you believe you can.

00:02:15.321 --> 00:02:19.488
To be on top, to be honest with
you, for me, is a let down.

00:02:20.892 --> 00:02:24.188
We've run outta rock to climb.

00:02:24.188 --> 00:02:28.089
Right now, Devils Tower,
if I had to pick one word,

00:02:28.089 --> 00:02:30.256
is home for me; I'm happy.

00:02:35.763 --> 00:02:38.513
(lively chiming)

